<title>LATVIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 3.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 3.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the main headlines of the news reported by Radio Latvia on Thursday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- U.S. Secretary of state Madeleine Albright will visit Vilnius on July 8 after the Madrid summit.</p>
<p>- Latvia fails to comply with the recommendations of the Council of the Baltic Sea states by refusing non-citizens the right to vote in municipal elections.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
